# Byte-exactness is a load-bearing property of this repo (NFR-3, invariant I8):
# the golden ledger and the committed LLM cache are compared byte-for-byte on a
# reviewer's machine. Normalise every text file to LF in the working tree so a
# Windows checkout produces the same bytes a Linux checkout does.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts must never be line-ending-normalised (the demo GIF, and the
# voice-demo.mp3 once a Sarvam key produces it).
*.gif binary
*.mp3 binary
*.png binary
*.wav binary
